	"data": "Cover Letter Christopher DiCarlo Artefact Group\n\nJuly 24, 2020\nArtefact Group\nSeattle, WA\nRe: Freelance Unity/Game Developer\nDear Hiring Manager,\nI am applying for the position of Freelance Unity/Game Developer.\nI am very interested in this position. I believe I am a solid fit for this work, including experience with Unity, C#, version control software, and shaders.\nI have been studying and developing programs with Unity and C# for the last couple of years and have a high degree of knowledge…",
